      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Normally, the [`AVCaptureStillImageOutput`](avcapturestillimageoutput.md) class emits images with the same dimensions as the source [`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md) instance’s [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md).",
      "normalizedSource": "Normally, the [`AVCaptureStillImageOutput`](avcapturestillimageoutput.md) class emits images with the same dimensions as the source [`AVCaptureDevice`](avcapturedevice.md) instance’s [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md).",
